Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:00:58.48,LongFormSubs,,0,0,0,,{\fs54}are tired We\Nare overwhelmed by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:00.94,LongFormSubs,,0,0,0,,{\fs54}the noise of\Nour own thoughts
